            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-3xl font-black text-[#38BDF8]">$2.4-6k</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1">Typical 600 sq ft driveway</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-3xl font-black text-white">$2-4</p>
              <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1">Per sq ft for an overlay</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-3xl font-black text-[#FF4500]">15-20 yr</p>
